{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_202602090134336049f7b0d2ea4623","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"glm-4.7","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Based on my analysis of the codebase and the prompt-modelo.md requirements, I can now explore design directions for the Dra Gel - Clínica website.\n\n## Design Exploration for Dra Gel - Clínica\n\nLooking at the previous implementations, I see we've used many distinctive palettes:\n- Amethyst & Platinum (mystical crystalline)\n- Rose Gold & Champagne Diamond (elegant luxury)\n- Porcelain & Rouge (medical-elegant)\n- Chrome & Electric Violet (futuristic)\n- Sapphire & Champagne (trustworthy)\n- Coral & Seafoam (coastal)\n- Burgundy & Gold (royal)\n- And many more...\n\nFor **Dra Gel - Clínica**, I want to create something completely new that stands out. Let me explore aesthetic directions:"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"fc31f120-013d-457b-a233-4e9c3911e39e","uuid":"0fe112d7-0bd4-40ea-a27c-9260d95d72c1"}
